      "value": "\"SteamVR detects game pads as a FBT trackers and puts you into calibration mode. Work around this by checking your SteamVR before launching VRChat, and if you see an additional controller, unplug it\" https://docs.vrchat.com/v2018.4.3/docs/latest-release",
